  "description": "Juju fell in love with Jin Lei, the God of War, at first glance. The problem is, he doesn't seem to know she exists.\n\nDetermined to sweep him off his feet, she accompanies him down to the mortal realm as he takes on three trials to attain greater divinity. However, in those three lifetimes that are given to them, will she be able to make him love her back?\n\n[Original Novel](https://tapas.io/series/threelifetimes/info)  \n[Original Webtoon](https://tapas.io/series/threelifetimes-comic/info)",
